{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "What are tokens?", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/4958f21c6794dd492fc5af2964139509faa7623b757ab90c758c78e1807dc66f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.86]]}, {"text": "Pealing back the onion, LLMs speak in tokens.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/337ead8e1dc59467ce8c2c38b6a702d25870b189fccd7328dced9f04518a6d2e.mp3"}, {"text": "Computers understand numbers and are really good at performing calculations with them, but too many numbers (and too many calculations) will have slow performance.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/a9a7abf9096f57905fddfaef9a611993183d0d97171136f5224135735959e7b1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58], [1, 0.58, 1.02], [2, 1.02, 1.5], [3, 1.5, 1.96], [4, 1.96, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.3], [6, 2.3, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 3.0], [9, 3.0, 3.54], [10, 3.54, 4.02], [11, 4.02, 4.3], [12, 4.54, 4.86], [13, 4.86, 5.06], [14, 5.06, 5.24], [15, 5.24, 5.6], [16, 5.6, 6.14], [17, 6.14, 6.32], [18, 6.32, 6.5], [19, 6.5, 7.2], [20, 7.2, 7.92], [21, 7.92, 8.12], [22, 8.12, 8.36], [23, 8.36, 8.84]]}, {"text": "Enter tokens.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3baefb05da5e34716182edef869cdcb47c2c2caf24e57123d5593ac10ee2b1b1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.68]]}, {"text": "Tokens are seemly random chunks of letters (sometimes english words, sometimes not) that are represented by a number.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/46dfb9c817137c2073678599f5dc064b57aef09364aea23ac7674a89186b7f37.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66], [1, 0.66, 0.84], [3, 1.24, 1.64], [4, 1.64, 1.96], [5, 1.96, 2.24], [6, 2.24, 2.52], [7, 3.04, 3.46], [8, 3.46, 3.96], [9, 3.96, 4.34], [10, 4.76, 5.08], [11, 5.08, 5.48], [12, 5.74, 5.94], [13, 5.94, 6.04], [14, 6.04, 6.54], [15, 6.54, 6.78], [16, 6.78, 6.92], [17, 6.92, 7.16]]}, {"text": "This compression from individual letters to chunks of letters reduces the number of calculations a computer needs to run in LLM, since one token may represent an entire word.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/5b47ab081c57c9cc9b2e30a131a29b463f8e02c7ce7a0a69f3425c859af65b05.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.54], [4, 1.54, 1.86], [5, 1.86, 2.22], [6, 2.22, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 2.94], [9, 2.94, 3.5], [10, 3.5, 3.78], [11, 3.78, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.2], [13, 4.2, 4.78], [14, 4.78, 5.06], [15, 5.06, 5.38], [16, 5.38, 5.68], [17, 5.68, 5.92], [18, 5.92, 6.12], [19, 6.12, 6.38], [20, 6.38, 7.0], [21, 7.3, 7.54], [22, 7.54, 7.78], [23, 7.78, 8.18], [24, 8.18, 8.46], [25, 8.46, 8.92], [26, 8.92, 9.16], [27, 9.16, 9.56], [28, 9.56, 9.86]]}, {"text": "OpenAI has a tokenizer playground for exploring how characters map to tokens.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c28d18a11cb60597927566dcdc37e4d3d3969cb00fe6d709050fde31ccf7c44b.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.7, 1.12], [2, 1.12, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.72], [4, 1.72, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.66], [6, 2.66, 3.14], [7, 3.14, 3.32], [8, 3.32, 3.66], [9, 3.66, 3.9], [10, 3.9, 4.08], [11, 4.08, 4.38]]}, {"text": "Notice how ' back' or ' onion' are full tokens, but 'Pealing' comprises 2 tokens ('P' and 'ealing').", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/34bf4893ef7a5dacee8bbe73dd1f78abf100104b01a8b8d212426243a53621a5.mp3"}, {"text": "An overly simple reason for this is OpenAI defined these tokens based on the most common in their dataset.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1ae8f829541a4f69b2d1c83ef58b9f8a293e1eae11ab8b617136388e60fe3466.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.78], [9, 2.6, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.2], [11, 3.2, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 3.84], [13, 3.84, 3.92], [14, 3.92, 4.14], [15, 4.14, 4.5], [16, 4.5, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 4.78]]}, {"text": "Common words are given their own token and less common words are comprised of smaller tokens.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/60fe08d61ce5ff6c924b02d5ccd0409aca1c2ea5af3e866d8094ce882173ab75.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.68], [7, 1.9, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 2.76], [11, 2.76, 2.92], [12, 2.92, 3.28], [13, 3.28, 3.58], [14, 3.58, 3.92], [15, 3.92, 4.32]]}, {"text": "Prompts with large samples create many tokens.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/5a003be2d5afd096c3e3d2997265e3acf152ffba1dd10333f85c852feda7f8fd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.72], [5, 1.72, 2.04], [6, 2.04, 2.44]]}, {"text": "More tokens, means higher costs.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d0e0b511759812bae722d6f49a0d1fb04832e3d7f7ba7f67453eead651838152.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.54], [4, 1.54, 2.1]]}, {"text": "LLMs can actually batch respond to prompts if you build your prompt correctly so that the same samples can be applied to the same requests.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/88339fff190726e3a531a38681ccdcf579d57b1801b9e04e64abdffdbd19ce16.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.72], [1, 0.72, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.34], [3, 1.34, 1.64], [4, 1.64, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.32], [6, 2.32, 2.62], [7, 2.62, 3.0], [8, 3.0, 3.12], [9, 3.12, 3.32], [10, 3.32, 3.48], [11, 3.48, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 4.3], [13, 4.3, 4.78], [14, 4.78, 4.94], [15, 4.94, 5.08], [16, 5.08, 5.32], [17, 5.32, 5.68], [18, 5.68, 5.96], [19, 5.96, 6.08], [20, 6.08, 6.4], [21, 6.4, 6.62], [22, 6.62, 6.74], [23, 6.74, 6.98], [24, 6.98, 7.32]]}, {"text": "The Experience + Slogan examples consist of 62 tokens.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d921f1439b68bc62e8314c32bf9d83753c778e11901a49a3d1a2752dd4479215.mp3"}, {"text": "The actual prompt itself is 17 tokens, only 25% of the total prompt token count.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/95ceb29501a591e9a8a3c81ed017a6d8d8fc08074109767030b88f674066baa3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.42], [7, 2.68, 2.86], [8, 2.86, 3.36], [9, 3.72, 3.94], [10, 3.94, 4.04], [11, 4.04, 4.26], [12, 4.26, 4.62], [13, 4.62, 4.96], [14, 4.96, 5.34]]}, {"text": "If you have multiple prompts that have the same examples, then you can use the same examples for multiple prompts in a single prompt.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d7f4ccf3e4b34a1b548da3960d7a2392eefba32391fb48b9173055af06036c26.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.48], [10, 3.02, 3.14], [11, 3.14, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.4], [13, 3.4, 3.56], [14, 3.56, 3.74], [15, 3.74, 3.96], [16, 3.96, 4.48], [17, 4.48, 4.68], [18, 4.68, 4.98], [19, 4.98, 5.44], [20, 5.44, 5.66], [21, 5.66, 5.74], [22, 5.74, 6.0], [23, 6.0, 6.38]]}, {"text": "This may sound confusing, but let me break it down.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/051ff537fe37ca6c9aecc861d670d53230a61d45980823741156b16e831d4ddf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 1.1], [4, 1.4, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.28]]}, {"text": "Save money with batch prompts", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/8909d335b83a32eb1fe04a887bab5aad008294170b3a3f32109a62ade0cf1894.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.32], [4, 1.32, 1.62]]}, {"text": "With batch prompting, the model will respond to multiple prompts within a single prompt, minimizing the number of tokens that need to be created.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/80f8a72ebda5babb48d2ccd9282e1c3cd8734d2380510a693e5c5e75fba0c17b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 1.04], [3, 1.32, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.56], [8, 2.56, 2.88], [9, 2.88, 3.3], [10, 3.3, 3.62], [11, 3.62, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 4.0], [13, 4.0, 4.48], [14, 4.86, 5.14], [15, 5.14, 5.56], [16, 5.56, 5.74], [17, 5.74, 5.94], [18, 5.94, 6.18], [19, 6.18, 6.42], [20, 6.42, 6.58], [21, 6.58, 6.72], [22, 6.72, 6.84], [23, 6.84, 7.26]]}, {"text": "Samples are created and defined separately from the results.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/e0f0517fa0f35ab8bfa8e1df83c6aaa404d0dd8232616ae464a38b3efe2f8fb2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.12], [7, 2.12, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.6]]}, {"text": "Input prompt", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/eb81ded8ee1ac54f78092cd5c9462ffdf3b8c08569a11448324371ae5da837d3.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.4, 0.84]]}, {"text": "(153 tokens)", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/066a6640bb5e37d548e858942191b2dde330a008a219c22c5f8e9e406bd211e1.mp3"}, {"text": "LLM Output", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/e4eb85ebc75009b70558c56ce89ff057a8a4e483f5bf61ab88329759fa444d0f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.7], [1, 0.7, 1.1]]}, {"text": "GPT perfectly associated the experience number with the slogan (without leaking any information across experiences).", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/9544db28c897d537c97298d7ff6bbf106e517d20c3552f13873bbd685f1582fa.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.64], [3, 1.64, 1.9], [4, 1.9, 2.4], [5, 2.4, 2.82], [6, 2.82, 3.08], [7, 3.08, 3.2], [8, 3.2, 3.5], [10, 4.2, 4.62], [11, 4.62, 4.96], [12, 4.96, 5.5], [13, 5.5, 5.8], [14, 5.8, 6.54]]}, {"text": "The batch prompt used 153 tokens, whereas single prompts used 66, 73, and 97 tokens respectively (totaling 236 tokens).", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/cf260ffee28379eb119f406a466385de2723cf5a1b1c7737301b3aba1e61e81c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [3, 0.6, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.96], [5, 1.96, 2.32], [6, 2.7, 2.94], [7, 2.94, 3.28], [8, 3.28, 3.64], [9, 3.64, 3.94], [10, 3.94, 4.48], [11, 5.0, 5.36], [13, 5.86, 6.3], [14, 6.3, 6.8], [15, 6.8, 7.46], [16, 7.94, 8.32], [17, 8.32, 9.26], [18, 9.26, 9.66]]}, {"text": "With batch prompting using this example, there is a 64% token reduction and cost savings, while achieving similar accuracy.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/4697dd212fbae3def04a397723fd0aee7448312f9b47952e3e2c9f191b363b81.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.76], [6, 1.98, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.62], [10, 3.06, 3.38], [11, 3.38, 3.84], [12, 3.84, 4.18], [13, 4.18, 4.44], [14, 4.44, 4.92], [15, 5.26, 5.4], [16, 5.4, 5.76], [17, 5.76, 6.18], [18, 6.18, 6.66]]}, {"text": "Final thoughts", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/a9b62b7f9a0360c20d11fae2f377d4d5b7fb772b18629b8aa34c96aff32cbdcc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.72]]}, {"text": "This technique reduces LLM costs by 50%+ at minimal accuracy degrdation.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/175507529916cfed8cc1f46efd5b5fd165ca7ff796e2e2be617c31dc679403a3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 1.12], [3, 1.12, 1.68], [4, 1.68, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.24], [6, 2.24, 2.6], [7, 3.24, 3.54], [8, 3.54, 3.86], [9, 3.86, 4.28]]}, {"text": "This technique is perfect for processing millinos of prompts for summarization or entity extraction, but at a low cost.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/7fd850db446a7122db28c28cad19add94e5fa3afa28326afa83d5b24b24ca23f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.82], [7, 2.42, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.8], [11, 3.8, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.36], [13, 4.36, 4.98], [14, 5.4, 5.66], [15, 5.66, 5.76], [16, 5.76, 5.86], [17, 5.86, 6.0], [18, 6.0, 6.28]]}, {"text": "A word of warning: this technique isn’t free.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/8303032640eb63b979e6d26be26c1e4985bd6f38d405ca31eb2f63e860ebe9eb.mp3"}, {"text": "There is ~3% decline in accuracy comparing a batch size of 4 to a single prompt, with an even sharper drop of accuracy from batch sizes of 4 to batch sizes of 6.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/7213fe5c9d5bbe05074838553f26ed7470e440c842fd6340b8a7575a9c80dabf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.82], [3, 1.14, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 2.16], [6, 2.16, 2.8], [7, 2.8, 3.04], [8, 3.04, 3.26], [9, 3.26, 3.54], [10, 3.54, 3.78], [11, 3.78, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.36], [13, 4.36, 4.48], [14, 4.48, 4.74], [15, 4.74, 5.22], [16, 5.48, 5.64], [17, 5.64, 5.76], [18, 5.76, 6.02], [19, 6.02, 6.4], [20, 6.4, 6.7], [21, 6.7, 6.92], [22, 6.92, 7.42], [23, 7.42, 7.72], [24, 7.72, 8.0], [25, 8.0, 8.42], [26, 8.42, 8.68], [27, 8.68, 8.9], [28, 8.9, 9.04], [29, 9.04, 9.26], [30, 9.26, 9.66], [31, 9.66, 9.88], [32, 9.88, 10.16]]}, {"text": "Additional reading", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/77a365fe7339f06a488dcde225a7a8672ffc769fea29a5c62c3966ef302a49eb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 0.88]]}, {"text": "Batch Prompting: Efficient Inference with Large Language Model APIs (arxiv.org)", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/45b923ad637bf70875262691151d0762d52301eebfd9d7ec61319a3d497b9105.mp3"}, {"text": "Prompt Engineering Reading Library (github.com)", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/181cd9ec362f854b012d2e7cf84c9f189dcfdf7a4d741c3fba298921a7cf51d3.mp3"}, {"text": "Prompt Engineering Walk-through colab notebook (github.com)", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/73c9e29cc8f5e327e0cb8ba1181f6471870fe727f7cbbffb86f48709167f317b.mp3"}]}